{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49514","headline":"诉衷情 三 · 魏承班","name":"诉衷情 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银汉云情玉漏长，蛩声悄画堂。\n筠簟冷，碧窗凉，红蜡泪飘香。\n皓月泻寒光，割人肠。\n那堪独自步池塘，对鸳鸯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}